<title>JAPAN: April Nikkei options settled at 17,472.25 -brokers.</title>
<headline>April Nikkei options settled at 17,472.25 -brokers.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers estimated that the Nikkei average's options contracts for April were settled at 17,472.25 on Friday.</p>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange will announce official data on the settlement of options after the market closes at 3.00 p.m. (0600 GMT).</p>
</text>
